msgctxt "136"
msgid "Kiryu-san! Konichiwa!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Who're you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Aw, did you forget about me!? It's me, Maxim Soldadov!\r\n"
"We fought in the Underground Coliseum!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Oh, yeah. Maxim. The boxer, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Yeah! That's me! So you <Italic>do</Italic> remember me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Yeah. So what do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "I have a favor to ask."
msgstr "Ho un favore da chiederti."

msgctxt "220"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "E cioè?"

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"I want you to compete in the Tag Match Grand Prix\r\n"
"in the Underground Coliseum with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "The Tag Match Grand Prix?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Yes, exactly! The Tag Match Grand Prix!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Why me, though?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "I came from the Ukraine in search of true strength."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"I thought back to the last time we fought and realized\r\n"
"that you definitely have that strength."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "You really think so...?"
msgstr "Lo pensi davvero?"

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"Yeah! And I'm not talking about just physical strength,\r\n"
"either. I mean <Italic>true</Italic> strength. I saw it in you that day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"I decided that I wanted to learn that strength from you...\r\n"
"That's when I heard about the Tag Match Grand Prix."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"If we fight together in the Tag Match Grand Prix, I'll get\r\n"
"to see you fight, right up close!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "It'd be the perfect opportunity!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Please, Kiryu-san! Join the Tag Match Grand Prix with me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "(Hmm. This guy might make a good tag match partner...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "Okay. Let's do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Really!? Thank you, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"Sure, but I don't know if I can teach you this \"true\r\n"
"strength\" you're talking about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"Don't worry about that! It's not something you can teach.\r\n"
"It's something I can steal from you! Isn't that the\r\n"
"Japanese way? Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr "Eh."

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"Yay! Lucky me! I can't believe you're going to be my\r\n"
"partner!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid ""
"I heard all the Grand Prix fighters are having trouble\r\n"
"finding partners."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "Is that right?"
msgstr "È così?"

msgctxt "496"
msgid "I guess it's not that easy to find a good tag partner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "Guess not."
msgstr "Eh, no."

msgctxt "520"
msgid "Well, I'm going to head over to the Coliseum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "All right."
msgstr "Va bene."

msgctxt "544"
msgid "Come on by anytime!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "Why not?"
msgstr "Perché no?"

msgctxt "640"
msgid ""
"I'm not the man you think I am. I think you'd eventually\r\n"
"regret teaming up with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid ""
"No, I wouldn't! You're the one I want for my partner.\r\n"
"There's no way I would ever regret it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "You sure about that?"
msgstr "Sei sicuro di quello?"

msgctxt "676"
msgid ""
"Absolutely! I'm determined to fight with you! Please,\r\n"
"Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid "Ugh... all right."
msgstr "Uff... Va bene."

msgctxt "700"
msgid "Really!?"
msgstr "Davvero!?"

msgctxt "712"
msgid ""
"Yeah, but I don't know if I can teach you this \"true\r\n"
"strength\" you're talking about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid ""
